{"id":4896,"date":"2025-07-31T11:00:50","date_gmt":"2025-07-31T11:00:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4896"},"modified":"2025-08-11T07:10:44","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T07:10:44","slug":"cach-chan-bo-chan-nguoi-dung-tren-tiktok","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-chan-bo-chan-nguoi-dung-tren-tiktok\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch ch\u1eb7n, b\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean TikTok nhanh, \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"MFjZdIT6Do12SfxBieJlpfzWgEm\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EHh0drqXSogvTnxu3RTlrtRCgph\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u1eb7n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, tr\u00e1nh kh\u1ecfi nh\u1eefng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ti\u00eau c\u1ef1c hay kh\u00f4ng mong mu\u1ed1n. Ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i thao t\u00e1c c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c v\u00e0o n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4i ph\u1ee5c k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i khi c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft. Vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng n\u00e0y \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch s\u1ebd gi\u00fap m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng TikTok c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u1edf n\u00ean t\u00edch c\u1ef1c v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n h\u01a1n. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung ho\u1eb7c kinh doanh tr\u00ean TikTok, \u0111\u1eebng qu\u00ean theo d\u00f5i <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">Lemon Digital<\/span><\/strong><\/a> \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\u00eam nhi\u1ec1u th\u1ee7 thu\u1eadt t\u1ed1i \u01b0u t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MQJldUa6ToJ3KsxwnnDlHdvvg9d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ANUvdUVpnoUCSmx36xZl5A8Rg5b\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. L\u1ee3i \u00edch c\u1ee7a vi\u1ec7c ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4900\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4900\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4900\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-4.png\" alt=\"m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t ai c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean TikTok.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-4.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-4-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-4-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-4-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-4-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4900\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">M\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t ai c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OvANd9UuaoXW8pxfad6lkTgegFf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean TikTok mang l\u1ea1i m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u1ee3i \u00edch, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 s\u1ef1 an to\u00e0n c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IZV9dqYxAoe2Wgx62mml2HGggTg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>1. B\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 s\u1ef1 ri\u00eang t\u01b0<\/strong>: Ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng gi\u00fap ng\u0103n h\u1ecd xem h\u1ed3 s\u01a1, video ho\u1eb7c b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c an to\u00e0n h\u01a1n. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t h\u1eefu \u00edch khi b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi l\u1ea1 ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng mong mu\u1ed1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cc4wdzaa7oFkJdxyUxJlOCzZg8v\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>2. Ng\u0103n ch\u1eb7n qu\u1ea5y r\u1ed1i ho\u1eb7c b\u1eaft n\u1ea1t<\/strong>: N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n g\u1eb7p ph\u1ea3i b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn ti\u00eau c\u1ef1c, tin nh\u1eafn kh\u00f4ng mong mu\u1ed1n ho\u1eb7c h\u00e0nh vi qu\u1ea5y r\u1ed1i, vi\u1ec7c ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng s\u1ebd c\u1eaft \u0111\u1ee9t li\u00ean l\u1ea1c, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n tr\u00e1nh c\u0103ng th\u1eb3ng v\u00e0 duy tr\u00ec tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m t\u00edch c\u1ef1c tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J3JPdOZ1Eo8aVlxRGaUl6EJpgQI\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>3. Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c<\/strong>: Ch\u1eb7n cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng g\u00e2y phi\u1ec1n h\u00e0, nh\u01b0 spam ho\u1eb7c troll, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o c\u00e1c t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c t\u00edch c\u1ef1c v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ouk4d68kfo30s4xd2yxlhZcDgqd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>4. Gi\u1ea3m phi\u1ec1n nhi\u1ec5u<\/strong>: N\u1ebfu n\u1ed9i dung ho\u1eb7c h\u00e0nh vi c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng l\u00e0m b\u1ea1n kh\u00f3 ch\u1ecbu (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i n\u1ed9i dung kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p), ch\u1eb7n h\u1ecd s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n th\u1ea5y b\u00e0i \u0111\u0103ng ho\u1eb7c th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o t\u1eeb h\u1ecd.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M5RZdrqiAoj3DHxYdtxlQD91g3d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>5. T\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng an to\u00e0n cho tr\u1ebb em<\/strong>: \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ph\u1ee5 huynh, ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng l\u1ea1 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u00e1ng ng\u1edd tr\u00ean t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok c\u1ee7a con m\u00ecnh gi\u00fap b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 tr\u1ebb kh\u1ecfi nh\u1eefng n\u1ed9i dung ho\u1eb7c t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c kh\u00f4ng an to\u00e0n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ij49dsOCgoMZNyxAHWRlCwjOgbd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>6. Duy tr\u00ec s\u1ef1 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i t\u00e2m l\u00fd<\/strong>: Lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ti\u00eau c\u1ef1c gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n duy tr\u00ec tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i tinh th\u1ea7n t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n, tr\u00e1nh b\u1ecb \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng b\u1edfi nh\u1eefng b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng g\u00e2y t\u1ed5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NzbkdqDxsol47OxOnpglfrdBgth\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u01b0u \u00fd r\u1eb1ng vi\u1ec7c ch\u1eb7n tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 ri\u00eang t\u01b0; ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ecb ch\u1eb7n s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o, v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 l\u00fac n\u00e0o n\u1ebfu mu\u1ed1n. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n g\u1eb7p v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 nghi\u00eam tr\u1ecdng h\u01a1n (nh\u01b0 \u0111e d\u1ecda), h\u00e3y c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc b\u00e1o c\u00e1o ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u00f3 cho TikTok \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f3 bi\u1ec7n ph\u00e1p x\u1eed l\u00fd ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ge7qdhohAo6P0LxLzoIlxFS3gBe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WfksdYfcpoMD6XxCt49lCG8lgMZ\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. C\u00e1ch ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MLZ3dG3eUouFmjxlTqUlHqY8gOf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: V\u00e0o trang c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n ch\u1eb7n \u2192 Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u0169i t\u00ean chia s\u1ebb \u1edf g\u00f3c tr\u00ean b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N1bNdkhVlouCNRxNLwklPo7Rgrg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: \u1ede phia tr\u00ean c\u00f9ng b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i ch\u1ecdn m\u0169i t\u00ean chia s\u1ebb \u2192 ch\u1ecdn bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u201cCh\u1eb7n\u201d (h\u00ecnh tr\u00f2n c\u00f3 g\u1ea1ch ch\u00e9o).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MpdzdclKvorcOrxHiQflLNVNgme\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: TikTok s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u2192 Nh\u1ea5n n\u00fat &#8220;Ch\u1eb7n&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W6fFdImO8oKDqmxQ4XDl2P6BgAd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Sau khi ch\u1eb7n, t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u201c\u0110\u00e3 ch\u1eb7n\u201d, v\u00e0 h\u1ecd s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 xem, nh\u1eafn tin ho\u1eb7c t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MrNkdbfh3oHxQmxZCSRl2pE9gLb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4903\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4903\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4903\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/CHAN.png\" alt=\"Sau khi ch\u1eb7n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00f3 s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 xem, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/CHAN.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/CHAN-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/CHAN-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/CHAN-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/CHAN-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4903\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Sau khi ch\u1eb7n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00f3 s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 xem, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"MFjZdIT6Do12SfxBieJlpfzWgEm\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-AzJHdbC8Ro3MhixNBc0lOeaFglb\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. C\u00e1ch b\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YoByd6r9soA9OVxKJCVl7NMwgAg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp l\u1ea1i trang c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb ch\u1eb7n \u2192 Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u0169i t\u00ean chia s\u1ebb nh\u01b0 ban \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BTA7dYO3JoxExSxAHfSlv9qYgtC\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Trong menu hi\u1ec7n ra, ch\u1ecdn bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u201cB\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n\u201d (t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 v\u1ecb tr\u00ed n\u00fat &#8220;Ch\u1eb7n&#8221; tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00f3).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CAipds3lcoxxYRxkG0flBV0XgWe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Sau khi b\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd th\u1ea5y n\u00fat Follow v\u00e0 Tin nh\u1eafn quay tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ed3ng ngh\u0129a hai b\u00ean c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 xem n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ee7a nhau nh\u01b0 b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KCEadLf2PoOJUAxzOuklWTHxgnh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4902\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4902\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4902\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/BO-CHAN.png\" alt=\"Sau khi b\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i n\u1ed9i dung, nh\u1eafn tin v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi b\u1ea1n nh\u01b0 tr\u01b0\u1edbc (n\u1ebfu t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 ri\u00eang t\u01b0).\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/BO-CHAN.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/BO-CHAN-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/BO-CHAN-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/BO-CHAN-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/BO-CHAN-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4902\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Sau khi b\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i n\u1ed9i dung, nh\u1eafn tin v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi b\u1ea1n nh\u01b0 tr\u01b0\u1edbc (n\u1ebfu t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 ri\u00eang t\u01b0).<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"MFjZdIT6Do12SfxBieJlpfzWgEm\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WdohdZxZooFrhGx0qvnl7uRLgJh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4. L\u01b0u \u00fd khi ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng kh\u00e1c tr\u00ean TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YguTdHIB0otkImxpAtzlQcc4gRf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u01b0u \u00fd khi ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng kh\u00e1c tr\u00ean TikTok s\u1ebd c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1ch hai b\u00ean t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. V\u00ec v\u1eady, h\u00e3y c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc k\u1ef9 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi ch\u1eb7n \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh hi\u1ec3u l\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng mong mu\u1ed1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ps0rdUaCVoS1PzxfHVDlTAbFgGe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Kh\u00f4ng nh\u1eadn th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o<\/strong>: TikTok kh\u00f4ng th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ecb ch\u1eb7n, nh\u01b0ng h\u1ecd c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn ra n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n th\u1ea5y n\u1ed9i dung ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 nh\u1eafn tin cho b\u1ea1n.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IMjndLoOYobzVoxk5Yil9jZLgag\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ng\u1eaft to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c<\/strong>: Khi b\u1ecb ch\u1eb7n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00f3 s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 xem video, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, nh\u1eafn tin hay truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n n\u1eefa. T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00f3 c\u0169ng s\u1ebd b\u1ecb \u1ea9n.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JTgYdoyPpoH2oNxiI9elFfOVgkl\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 tag hay duet<\/strong>: Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ecb ch\u1eb7n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 g\u1eafn th\u1ebb b\u1ea1n, duet hay stitch v\u1edbi video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QKjgdObzIoZzs2xwFCFlUG95gWb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Kh\u00f4ng lo\u1ea1i kh\u1ecfi danh s\u00e1ch theo d\u00f5i t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/strong>: N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang theo d\u00f5i ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00f3 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi ch\u1eb7n, h\u00e3y ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng <strong>h\u1ee7y theo d\u00f5i<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh gi\u1eef li\u00ean k\u1ebft.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vl1RdY87KoTjtRxYYGQlANYugYc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ch\u1eb7n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1eb7n tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i trong livestream<\/strong>: Trong m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ecb ch\u1eb7n v\u1eabn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 xem livestream c\u00f4ng khai (t\u00f9y v\u00e0o c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t quy\u1ec1n ri\u00eang t\u01b0).<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KALUdsIiZoSNMJx28AdlJ38HgUd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 l\u00fac n\u00e0o<\/strong>: B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 v\u00e0o trang c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 <strong>b\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n<\/strong>, nh\u01b0ng hai b\u00ean s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng follow l\u1ea1i nhau.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4901\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4901\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4901\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-4.png\" alt=\"m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng khi ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng kh\u00e1c tr\u00ean TikTok \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-4.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-4-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-4-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-4-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-4-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4901\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng khi ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng kh\u00e1c tr\u00ean TikTok<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hs4ld1bTno09E0xayiZlQPcNgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXjcdxwmZoWKXWx2UonlRnRagXf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DbKTdkhWYoO6U4xrDw5lJAneg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1uLdZxz9o0PTAxKBZRllhjTgUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O9KWdu2pTo6MwFxvXFgltbDcgse\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B0WcdXMVaocQq6xInUDlXkDrgNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"MFjZdIT6Do12SfxBieJlpfzWgEm\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A9nrdnFRRojYR6xRtculfbTKgkb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ch\u1eb7n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecf ch\u1eb7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, tr\u00e1nh kh\u1ecfi nh\u1eefng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ti\u00eau c\u1ef1c hay kh\u00f4ng mong mu\u1ed1n. Ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i thao t\u00e1c c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c v\u00e0o n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ee7a [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4959,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4896","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4896","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4896"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/lemo